+<div class="tsd-panel tsd-typography"><h1 id="🌌-project-novax-enterprise-framework-v020" class="tsd-anchor-link">🌌 Project NovaX Enterprise Framework (v0.2.0)<a href="#🌌-project-novax-enterprise-framework-v020" aria-label="Permalink" class="tsd-anchor-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="assets/icons.svg#icon-anchor"></use></svg></a></h1>
 <p>NovaX is a corporate-grade, highly optimized, completely modular application platform engineered in TypeScript on a strict ECMAScript Module (ESM) architecture. Built to support high-throughput, fault-tolerant Discord application infrastructures, NovaX features automated plugin workspace dependency sandboxing, cryptographic code-integrity and anti-tamper audits, a performance-tuned polyglot storage abstraction router, and an immutable context-injected dependency broker (<code>IHeart</code>) that eliminates global singletons while maintaining performance profiles.</p>
