 <h3 id="3-rest-api-interface-routers-" class="tsd-anchor-link">3. REST API Interface Routers (<code>BaseRoute</code>)<a href="#3-rest-api-interface-routers-" aria-label="Permalink" class="tsd-anchor-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="assets/icons.svg#icon-anchor"></use></svg></a></h3>
