 <h3 id="2-high-performance-component-interactivity-" class="tsd-anchor-link">2. High-Performance Component Interactivity (<code>ComponentEngine</code>)<a href="#2-high-performance-component-interactivity-" aria-label="Permalink" class="tsd-anchor-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="assets/icons.svg#icon-anchor"></use></svg></a></h3>
